// Survival theft scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: keep the survival loop alive for the hungry thief while making a
// displayed, owned apple lot at a concealed market stall the only truthful
// local food branch. The merchant can lawfully stage stock for sale, but the
// thief has no coin, no harvestable food source, and no remote food fallback.
// The proved branch is staged visible stock -> theft -> self-consume, while
// concealment limits immediate witness pickup, the stolen display leaves
// physical aftermath at the place, and the merchant later relays the theft
// suspicion to a support listener who did not directly witness the theft.
